  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ひかえの　ポケモンと　いれかわる。\nのうりょく　へんかは　かわった\nポケモンが　そのまま　うけつぐ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "교대 포켓몬과 바뀐다.\n능력 변화는 바뀐 포켓몬이\n그대로 이어받는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "與後備寶可夢進行替換。\n替換上場的寶可夢，\n將承接目前寶可夢的能力變化。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur échange sa place et tout changement\nde stat avec un Pokémon de l’équipe.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tauscht den Anwender aus und überträgt alle\nStatusveränderungen auf das eingewechselte\nPokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cambia el puesto con otro miembro del equipo y le\npasa los cambios de características.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa è sostituito da un Pokémon della squadra,\nche eredita anche ogni modifica alle statistiche.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user switches places with a party Pokémon in\nwaiting and passes along any stat changes.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "控えの　ポケモンと　入れ替わる。\n能力変化は　替わった\nポケモンが　そのまま　受けつぐ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "和后备宝可梦进行替换。\n换上的宝可梦\n能直接继承其能力的变化。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cambia el puesto con otro miembro del equipo y le\npasa los cambios de características.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
